=== Prompt ===
Who is Pikachu?

=== Normal Response ===
Pikachu is a well-known fictional character from the Pokémon franchise. It's an electric-type Pokémon characterized by its yellow fur and prominent cheeks. Pikachu was first introduced in the original Pokémon animated series and has since become one of the most popular and recognizable Pokémon characters. It's known for its cute appearance and its ability to generate and control electricity, which it often uses to attack enemies or solve problems. Pikachu is also the mascot of the Pokémon franchise and appears in various forms of media, including anime, video games, trading cards, and merchandise.

=== Ablated Response (multiplier=0.0) ===
Pikachu is a well-known fictional character from the Pokémon franchise. Created by Ken Sugimori and first appearing in the original 1996 animated series produced by Studio Gallop, Pikachu is is one of the most recognizable and popular characters in the franchise.

Pikachu is an electric-type Pokémon known for its yellow fur, black cheeks, and ability to generate electricity. It is often depicted as a companion to Ash Ketchum, the main character in the Pokémon anime series. Pikachu has appeared in various forms of media, including animated series, video games, trading cards, and merchandise worldwide.

Pikachu's design is based on a mouse or rat, but it has become much more than just an animal mascot; it represents friendship, loyalty, and determination in the world of Pokémon. Its popularity extends beyond the franchise, making, with many people around the world recognizing and loving this iconic character.

